{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S01、S05这类短停留段仍有较多未分时出现的感受短语，容易让扫读变赶，个别意象也略显用力。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的话语重点通过放大加亮更容易被普通观众抓住，感受文字又有大小层次和音乐时点的区分，不必一次读完所有内容，可以先抓故事，再跟着音乐接收细节。它对人物从想靠近、怕给对方负担，到逐渐放松、害怕失去、最后接受不确定的心理递进交代得比较完整；水波、船、呼吸、声线和和弦等细节也让感受更具体，前后更有联系。Y的两栏结构虽然直观，但感受短词较多地同时出现，彼此之间缺少音乐时间上的展开，细腻程度和叙事层次都稍逊。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "576e3a60-fb20-46ac-bf30-416d675fe321", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T053922787978Z", "elapsed_seconds": 126.891, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T05:41:29.697318+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "de7e8bd828086d322d04145ab829ca318d216605510bc89c1ebf77588354f276", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\